Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}comparar LSTM, Transformer e Informer.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.00,0:00:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Na LSTM, os valores entram em ordem.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A memória muda a cada passo, por portas\Naprendidas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Elas regulam o que reter, acrescentar e\Ntransmitir.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}O estado final ajuda a prever todo o\Nhorizonte.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.00,0:00:23.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}No Transformer, cada posição reúne valor e\Nordem temporal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.00,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Consultas comparam representações com suas\Nchaves.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.00,0:00:31.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Os pesos calculados orientam a combinação\Ndos valores.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Essas representações seguem para a\Nprevisão do horizonte.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.00,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Em sequências longas, o Informer detalha\Nalgumas consultas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.00,0:00:43.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A seleção usa uma estimativa de\Nesparsidade.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.00,0:00:47.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Em outra etapa, reduz a sequência interna\Ndo codificador.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.00,0:00:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A atenção cruzada permanece completa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.00,0:00:55.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}O mesmo histórico e ID entram nos três\Nmodelos.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.00,0:01:00.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Cada modelo produz diretamente um vetor\Npara o mesmo horizonte.
